  "body": "Entry Level Beachside Living!!!\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned opposite Orewa Beach and just a short stroll to cafes, restaurants and shops, this beautifully presented apartment offers an easy care lifestyle in a premium end position.\r\n\r\nIt's the ultimate lock up and leave, holiday home, or AirBnB investment opportunity. Given it is located on the end of the block, this apartment enjoys extra natural light throughout and has the added bonus of direct access to the pool from the courtyard. On the ground floor you'll find a generous double bedroom with an ensuite and courtyard access, making it easy to step straight out to the pool. Upstairs, the kitchen, dining and living area open to the balcony overlooking the pool. The top floor offers two generous bedrooms, including a master with its own balcony along with a second bathroom that services this level.\r\n\r\nComplete with internal access garaging, additional off street parking and the security of a gated complex, you can relax  knowing your apartment is secure and the maintenance is covered.  Leave the car at home and simply enjoy everything Orewa has to offer. Get settled for Summer... the beach, the pool and the vibrant township are all right on your doorstep.",
